# Uzi Network — environment variables for Cloudflare Pages

# These get set in Cloudflare dashboard → Pages project → Settings → Environment variables
# OR as GitHub repo secrets if deploying through GitHub Actions.
# NEVER commit this file with real values.

# --- Email provider (newsletter signup) ---
# The function at functions/api/subscribe.js auto-detects based on which vars are set.
# Pick ONE provider.

# Mailchimp
# MAILCHIMP_API_KEY=xxx-us12
# MAILCHIMP_LIST_ID=abc123def4
# MAILCHIMP_SERVER_PREFIX=us12

# ConvertKit
# CONVERTKIT_API_KEY=xxx
# CONVERTKIT_FORM_ID=1234567

# Buttondown
# BUTTONDOWN_API_KEY=xxx

# Resend
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxx
# RESEND_AUDIENCE_ID=aud_xxx

# --- Analytics (optional, do NOT enable until ready) ---
# Plausible
# PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=uzi.network.store
# PLAUSIBLE_API_KEY=xxx

# --- Social / content ---
# These are referenced in src/lib/site.ts and can be overridden as env vars
# SITE_NAME=Uzi Network
# SITE_URL=https://uzi.network.store